Appendix B — Claims Discipline
Separate four labels in every artifact: OBSERVED (direct repo/test evidence), EXECUTED (code actually run), INFERRED (reasonable architectural implication), and SPECULATIVE (candidate hypothesis). This preserves the Pantheon’s imaginative search range without allowing evocative coherence to masquerade as empirical confirmation.